OL,3,GNEWSAThe motor racing couple speed
OL,4,Adating with no brakes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young couple who are both speedway
OL,7,Friders have spoken about going
OL,8,Fhead-to-head on the track.
OL,10,FJody Scott, 19, from King's Lynn in
OL,11,FNorfolk, who this year claimed the
OL,12,FBritish under-19 championship, shone
OL,13,Friding for the Oxford Chargers.
OL,15,FTowards the end of this season he lined
OL,16,Fup for the Chargers against Edinburgh
OL,17,FMonarchs Academy, which included his
OL,18,F19-year-old Australian girlfriend Anika
OL,19,FLoftus.
